PARSFILE
#FullDataName Vehicle: Assembly`Pickup, Full Size: Lifted (SA_SA)`Pickup, Full Size
#VehCode SA_SA
#CheckBox0 0    
#CheckBox1 0    

#RingCtrl0 3
OPT_PT 3
#RingCtrl1 3
#RingCtrl2 3
#RingCtrl3 0

* Front components
iaxle 1
symbol_push  <<axle>> 1
WRITE_ADD_REFERENCE_FRAME_AXLE
